{
  "text": "PLATFORM CONTROL\nPlatform Owner\nPLATFORM CONTROL CENTER\nExecutive Dashboard\nRestaurant Health & Risk\nBUSINESS MANAGEMENT\nRestaurants\nRestaurant Owners\nBranches\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Billing\nSAAS MANAGEMENT\nOverview\nPlans & Entitlements\nFeature Catalog\nQR Ordering Suite\nWhatsApp Ordering\nJAMAN AI Engine\nMaster Menu Catalog\nActivation Keys\nPayment Gateways\nPlatform Payments\nRestaurant Payouts\nApplications & Releases\nOPERATIONS & MDM\nDevice Fleet / MDM\nSync & Conflict Monitor\nBackups & Recovery\nSystem Telemetry\nStatus History\nStaging Sandboxes\nSECURITY & REPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nMargin & Cost\nAudit Logs\nEmergency Offline Policy\nPlatform Team\nSupport Tickets\nDiagnostics & Support\nAnnouncements\nPlatform Settings\nACCOUNT\nMy Profile\nPlatform Online\nJAMANVAAR Cloud v1.4.0\nJAMANVAAR PLATFORM\nControl Center\nJ\nFeature Catalog\n\nThe database-backed catalog of every feature and category the platform recognises. Edits apply immediately across Plans, Entitlements and Application controls, with no deploy. Rollout % soft-launches an active feature to a slice of restaurants instead of all-or-nothing — currently enforced for QR ordering's capability-level flags.\n\n+ New Category\n+ New Feature\nPOS & Fast Billing\nFast counter billing, dine-in/takeaway/delivery/token order creation, discounts and automated tax calculation.\nEdit Category\nDine-In / Takeaway / Delivery / Token\nOrder-type selection at billing.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nPOS Terminal\nCounter billing terminal — order creation, item search and bill generation.\n\t\nPOS\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nPayments & Cash Drawer\nCash, UPI/BharatQR, card and split payments, cashier shifts, cash float and variance tracking.\nEdit Category\nMulti-Payment Tenders\nCash, UPI/BharatQR, card and split payments.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nShift & Cash Drawer\nCashier shift tracking, opening/closing cash and variance.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nTable & Floor Management\nVisual floor plan, multi-zone dining, table occupancy status, table merge, split and transfer.\nEdit Category\nTable Management\nVisual floor plan and table occupancy tracking.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nKitchen, KOT & KDS\nKOT generation, kitchen timers, multi-station kitchen routing, preparing/ready tracking and station load balancing.\nEdit Category\nKOT / KDS Routing\nKitchen order ticket generation and kitchen display routing.\n\t\nKDS\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nMenu & Inventory Management\nCategorized menu, item modifiers, recipe costing, dish availability toggles, stock adjustments and low stock alerts.\nEdit Category\nFood Customization\nItem modifiers and customization options.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nInventory Management\nStock tracking and dish availability toggles.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nMenu Management\nCategory and dish management.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nReports & GST\nStatutory GST reporting (CGST/SGST), daily sales summaries and discount reporting.\nEdit Category\nDiscounts & GST\nDiscount application and automated GST calculation.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nSales & GST Reports\nDaily sales and statutory GST reporting.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nOffline-First Operations\nLocal SQLite database, offline billing and order creation, automatic sync when back online.\nEdit Category\nOffline Billing\nLocal-first billing that works with no internet connection.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nPrinting & Hardware\n58mm/80mm ESC/POS thermal receipt printing and print queue management.\nEdit Category\nReceipt Printing\nThermal receipt and KOT printing.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nCustomer Management\nCustomer database, order/visit history and loyalty points.\nEdit Category\nCustomer Management\nCustomer database and order history.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nRestaurant Administration\nRestaurant settings, branch information, tax/bill/printer configuration, user and role management.\nEdit Category\nRestaurant Admin\nBack-office console for managing menu, staff and settings.\n\t\nPOS_ADMIN\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nWireless Captain / Waiter App\nTable-side ordering, course dispatch, order status tracking and waiter performance.\nEdit Category\nCaptain App\nWaiter-facing tableside ordering app.\n\t\nCAPTAIN\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nQR Table Ordering\nTable QR code, scan-to-order digital menu, customer cart and order submission direct to POS/kitchen.\nEdit Category\nQR Scheduled Pickup\nLets a guest schedule a QR order for pickup at a chosen time instead of immediate preparation.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nQR Service Requests\nLets a guest ask their table for water, cutlery, napkins, assistance or the bill directly from the QR menu, routed to the floor team's live request inbox.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nQR Table Ordering\nGuest self-ordering from a table's QR code.\n\t\nQR_ORDERING\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nSelf-Order Kiosk\nCustomer-facing self-ordering kiosk terminal and its Kiosk Admin management console.\nEdit Category\nKiosk Admin\nBack-office console for managing kiosk menu and settings.\n\t\nKIOSK_ADMIN\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nKiosk Remote Fleet Management\nRemote restart, cache clear, diagnostics, sync and update commands for kiosks (Kiosk Pro).\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nSelf-Order Kiosk\nSelf-service ordering kiosk terminal.\n\t\nKIOSK\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nReal-Time Multi-Machine Mesh Sync\nPOS/Captain/KDS/Kiosk real-time order, table, menu and availability synchronization.\nEdit Category\nReal-Time Multi-Machine Mesh Sync\nPOS/Captain/KDS/Kiosk real-time order and table synchronization.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nJAMANVAAR AI Restaurant Assistant\nNatural-language restaurant queries answered from local, offline data.\nEdit Category\nJAMAN AI Assistant\nOffline, local-data-based natural-language restaurant queries.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nAdvanced Analytics & CRM\nAdvanced sales analytics, channel performance, customer lifetime value and staff attribution.\nEdit Category\nAdvanced Analytics & CRM\nAdvanced sales analytics, channel performance and staff attribution.\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nWhatsApp Ordering\nConnects a restaurant to the Jamanvaar WhatsApp connector — customers order and pay from chat, orders land on POS/KDS only once paid.\nEdit Category\nWhatsApp Ordering\nCustomers order and pay from a WhatsApp chat via the Jamanvaar connector.\n\t\nWHATSAPP_ORDERING\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\nQR Advanced Features\nOptional QR capabilities using the shared licensing architecture\nEdit Category\nLow-bandwidth preferences\nAdditional customer presentation preferences\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nAdvanced QR branding\nReviewed restaurant presentation and cover imagery\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nVerified feedback\nPrivate completed-order feedback\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nShared table ordering\nInvite-only collaborative table sessions\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nAdvanced inventory controls\nExtended canonical inventory integration\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nKitchen workload\nAdvanced shared kitchen load controls\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nQR loyalty\nVerified customer loyalty and repeat ordering\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nQR menu performance\nCanonical menu sales and observable funnel analytics\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nAdvanced branch administration\nControlled central defaults and branch propagation\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nMultilingual menus\nCanonical menu text translations\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nOperational notifications\nRecoverable branch-scoped order alerts\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nGuest order history\nSecure browser-scoped order recovery\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nQR promotions\nCoupons and configured recommendations\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nSplit collections\nCanonical partial payment allocations\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete\n\nAdvanced usage controls\nConfigured optional usage quotas\n\t\t\nACTIVE\t\n%\n\tEditDeactivateDelete",
